msgstr "以字數計，5 到 80。中文與日文由 WordPress 以字元計算。"

#: inc/customizer.php
msgid "Accent colour"
msgstr "主色"

#: inc/customizer.php
msgid "For links, buttons and highlights. The theme makes its lighter and darker shades, and one for dark mode, dark or light enough to read. Leave it empty for the theme’s teal."
msgstr "用於連結、按鈕與強調色。佈景主題會自動產生較淺與較深的色調，以及深色模式的用色，並確保文字清楚可讀。留空則使用佈景主題的青藍色。"

#: inc/customizer.php
