#: inc/customizer.php
#, php-format
msgid "One change per line: the text as the site shows it, an equals sign, then the new text, such as “Latest travel stories = Recent posts”. Nothing after the equals sign hides the text. A text with %s or %d keeps them in the new text. Leave this empty for the theme’s own words."
msgstr "每行一項修改：網站上顯示的文字、一個等號，再接新的文字，例如「最新旅行故事 = 最新文章」。等號後面不寫任何字，就會隱藏那段文字。含有 %s 或 %d 的文字，新文字也要保留它們。留空則使用佈景主題原本的文字。"

#: inc/customizer.php
