#: inc/locations.php
msgid "Place name"
msgstr "地點名稱"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "Add stop"
msgstr "新增停留點"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "Click the map to set the location or add a stop. Drag a pin to move it."
msgstr "點選地圖可設定位置或新增停留點；拖曳圖釘可移動位置。"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "Click the map to add a stop. Drag a pin to move it."
msgstr "點選地圖可新增停留點；拖曳圖釘可移動位置。"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "VoyageLight · Geotag & Travel Map"
msgstr "VoyageLight · 地理標記與旅遊地圖"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "Paste coordinates or a map link, such as 39.8628, -4.0273 or 39°51′46″N 4°01′38″W. Links from Google Maps, Apple Maps and OpenStreetMap and geo: addresses work too. Leave it empty for no location."
msgstr "貼上座標或地圖連結，例如 39.8628, -4.0273 或 39°51′46″N 4°01′38″W。也可以使用 Google 地圖、Apple 地圖、OpenStreetMap 的連結和 geo: 位址。留空表示不設定位置。"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "Short links such as maps.app.goo.gl can’t be read here: open the link, then copy the full address from the browser’s address bar."
msgstr "這裡無法讀取 maps.app.goo.gl 之類的短網址：請先開啟連結，再從瀏覽器網址列複製完整網址。"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "Route stops"
msgstr "停留點"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "One stop per line: Place name | location | short note. The location takes the same forms as above."
msgstr "每行一個停留點：地點名稱 | 位置 | 簡短備註。位置的寫法與上方相同。"

#: inc/locations.php
msgid "Starting point"
